</div></section><section id="s17"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Data Availability</h2>
<p>All analysis code needed to reproduce the results in this paper is available on GitHub (<a href="https://github.com/jeroenvanbaar/PNAS_uncertainty_polarization" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://github.com/jeroenvanbaar/PNAS_uncertainty_polarization</a>). Source data is available from the authors upon reasonable request.</p></section><section id="ref-list1" class="ref-list"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">References</h2>
